./prompts/codex_req_v3_portraits.md:3:2. 章节顶层 `portrait_overrides: [{when, from, to}]`（build.py 按 bonuses 同样方式从 story/ 与 puzzle/ 合并）。engine 新增 `E.resolvePortrait(D, scene, st)`：按顺序检查，第一条 when 为真且 from == 场景 portrait 时返回 to，否则原值。when 用现有求值器。app.js 渲染立绘只用它。例：`{when: "flag:forced_export", from: mira_lv1, to: mira_broken}`。
